+        "ORD-0247",
+        C,
+        B,
+        CSS,
+        SUMMARY_RULE,
+        SUMMARY_RULE.replace("summary {", ".v8-advanced > summary {"),
+        "the single-page fix the widened acceptance exists to refuse: bookings passes, the AI sheet's "
